# App Dependencies Diagram

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "ctc-research.com"
        ACCOUNTS[accounts]
        BLOG[blog]
        CONTENT[content]
        LMS[lms]
        CORE[core]
    end

    subgraph "structa.cloud"
        S_ACCOUNTS[accounts]
        S_BLOG[blog]
        S_CONTENT[content]
        S_LMS[lms]
        S_CORE[core]
    end

    subgraph "Shared Packages"
        RSEAL[crafts-ai]
        OSOUL[django-fusion]
        GREP[django-fusion]
    end

    ACCOUNTS --> RSEAL
    BLOG --> RSEAL
    CONTENT --> RSEAL
    LMS --> RSEAL
    CORE --> RSEAL

    ACCOUNTS --> OSOUL
    CONTENT --> OSOUL
    LMS --> OSOUL

    ACCOUNTS --> GREP
    LMS --> GREP

    S_ACCOUNTS --> RSEAL
    S_BLOG --> RSEAL
    S_CONTENT --> RSEAL
    S_LMS --> RSEAL
    S_CORE --> RSEAL

    S_ACCOUNTS --> OSOUL
    S_CONTENT --> OSOUL
    S_LMS --> OSOUL

    S_ACCOUNTS --> GREP
    S_LMS --> GREP
```

## App Responsibilities

| App | Responsibility |
|-----|---------------|
| accounts | User profiles, authentication, settings |
| blog | Blog posts, tags, categories |
| content | Pages, base content types |
| lms | Courses, enrollments, certificates |
| core | CI/CD, utilities, routing |
